<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">KOL - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bakolosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAKOLOSI</para>
  <para style="h">AMARUBA EMWA ABAKOLOSI</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAKOLOSI<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abakolosi: Bantu b’e Kolosi; Banya-Kolosi; bantu bayûbaka e Kolosi.</char></note></para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi oku Maruba emwa Abakolosi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nnâmahanga warhurhenzagya omu bujà bw’omwizimya, aj’irhudêkereza omu Bwâmi bwa Mugala wâge muzigirwa, warhucungulaga anarhukûlira ebyâha. Oyo Mugala ye Mwâmi mukulu w’ebintu byoshi: <char style="iqt">Ye nshusho ya Nyamuzinda orhaboneka, ye Nfula omu biremwa byoshi.</char> <char style="vp">16</char> <char style="iqt">Bulya byoshi muli ye byalemagwa, emalunga n’en’igulu, ebiboneka n’ebirhaboneka, Entebe n’Amarhegesi, Amâmi n’Amahashe: byoshi byoshi ye wabilemaga, ye byanalemeragwa;</char> <char style="vp">17</char> <char style="iqt">n’embere bibêho byoshi, yêhe erhi ho abà, ye nabihereza okubâho byoshi.</char> <char style="vp">18</char> <char style="iqt">Kandi yêne y’irhwe ly’omubiri, yo Ekleziya; y’Imerero, ye Nfula omu bafîre; na ntyo ye murhanzi muli byoshi.</char> <char style="vp">19</char> <char style="iqt">Bulya Nyamuzinda alonzize okumuhiramwo obwimâna bwoshi,</char> <char style="vp">20</char> <char style="iqt">na muli ye alonzize okugalula ebintu byoshi omu bwîra bwâge, ebiri en’igulu n’ebiri emalunga, alêrha omurhûla n’omukò gw’omusalaba gwâge.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Paolo acîhânyire oku alwîra obwo buyêmêre lyo ahisa abandi bantu oku bwimâna buli muli Kristu. Ngasi mukristu agwêrhe ecâge cigabi c’amababale ga Kristu bulya ali cirumbu c’omubiri gwa Kristu, yo Ekleziya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nka kulya abà mîra bakâg’ijà omu Ndagâno ya Nnâmahanga olusiku lw’okukembûlwa, muli Kristu, Muhimanyi kuli byoshi, hali obukembûle buhyâhya, buyêrekîre abalume n’abakazi, bwo bubatizo: aha <char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:11-15">2, 11-15</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:10-14">3, 10-14</ref></char> harhuhugwîre ebyo <char style="iqt">« Muli ye mwakembwîrwe obukembûle burhajiragwa na nfune za muntu, mwahogola omubiri gwinyu gw’ecâha: obwôla bwo bukembûle bwa Kristu.</char> <char style="vp">12</char> <char style="iqt">Mwabishirwe haguma naye omu nshinda erhi mubatizibwa, kandi mwafûsire haguma naye omu nshinda erhi muyêmêra obuhashe bwa Nyamuzinda wamufûlaga omu bafù.</char> <char style="vp">13</char> <char style="iqt">Mwe mwâli mufîre erhi byâha binyu n’okurhakembûlwa kw’emibiri yinyu birhuma, ashubir’immuhà obuzîne haguma naye, arhubabalira ebyâha bîrhu byoshi,</char> <char style="vp">14</char> <char style="iqt">azaza ecêrhè c’omwenda rhwalimwo n’ebigabi byâco, acirhenza, acibamba oku musalaba.</char> <char style="vp">15</char> <char style="iqt">Nago Amâmi n’Amabashe aganyaga, agabonêsa enshonyi omu masù g’igulu lyoshi, anagagwârha mpira zâge.»</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Abemêzi bakola biremwa bihyâhya: <char style="iqt">«3, 10 mwacîhundikira omuhyâhya, olya ocîsêza okuhinduka nshusho y’Omulemi wâge, mpu lyo ahika oku bumanye bw’okunali.</char> <char style="vp">11</char> <char style="iqt">Aha harhaciri Mugereki erhi Muyahudi; harhaciri mukembûle erhi ntakembûlwa, harhaciri ba-ntamanywa n'Abashita</char>; <char style="iqt">harhaciri bajà erhi bantagengwa: akola Kristu yêne, ye byoshi muli boshi</char>. <char style="vp">12</char> <char style="iqt">Nka kulya binakwânîne abîshogwa ba Nnâmahanga, n’abatagatîfu n’abarhonyi bâge, mucihundikire omurhima gw’olukogo, n’obwonjo, n’obwîrhôhye, n’obutûdu, n’okulembera amalibuko.</char> <char style="vp">13</char> <char style="iqt">Mukâlemberana munababalirane aka­ba hali owagayîsize owâbo. Nyakasane ammubabalire: mumuyankirekwo olwiganyo.</char> <char style="vp">14</char> <char style="iqt">Ci kulusha okwo kwoshi, muzigirane, bulya obuzigire ly’ishwinjiro ly’obwimâna.»</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Paolo, ntumwa ya Kristu Yezu oku bulonza bwa Nyamuzinda, na mwene wîrhu Timoteyo, <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>oku batagatîfu na bene wîrhu bemêzi muli Kristu bali e Kolosi. Kuli mwe engalo n’omurhûla gwa Larha Nnâmahanga!<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omunkwa n’omusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Rhurhahusa okuvuga Nyamuzinda omunkwa, Îshe wa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, nka rhwammukengêra omu nsengero zîrhu, <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>bulya rhwayumvîrhe obuyêmêre bwinyu muli Kristu Yezu n’obuzigire bwinyu oku batagatîfu boshi, <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>kulya kubà mucîkubagire obulangâlire mubîkîrwe omu mpingu. Obwôla bulangâlire mwabuyumvîrhe omu Luderho lw’okuli, yo Myanzi y’Akalembe; <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>eyo Myanzi y’Akalembe yahisire emwinyu nk’oku yalumîre omu igulu lyoshi: yayâna emburho yanagandâza. Emwinyu nayo kwo na kwo, kurhenga lulya lusiku mwayumvagya mwanamanya enshôkano ya Nyamuzinda nk’oku enali, <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>bulya muyigîrizibwa n’Epafra, murhabâzi wîrhu muzigirwa omu mukolo na murhumisi wa Kristu okwânîne okucîkubagirwa. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Yêne warhumanyîsagya obuzigire bwinyu muli Mûka Mutagatîfu.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Co cirhumire, kurhenga lulya lusiku rhwayumvagyamwo ogwo mwanzi, rhurhahusa okummusengerera n’okushenga Nyamuzinda nti ammushobôze okumanya kwinjà obulonza bwâge, omu bushinganyanya bwoshi n’omu bumanye bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Na ntyo mubè n’olugendo lushingânîne Nyakasane, munamusimîse muli byoshi; muyâne amalehe omu ngasi bijiro binjà, munayûshûke omu kumanya Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="COL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Obuhashe bw’irenge lyâge bwâmmuzibuhya, muhash’ilembera amalibuko goshi n’oburhwâli haguma n’obushagaluke, <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>munavuge Larha Nyamuzinda omunkwa n’enshagali, owammushobôzagya enshôkano y’okushangîra iragi ly’abatagatîfu omu bulangashane. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Ye warhurhenzagya omu bujà bw’omwizimya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bujà bw’omwizimya gwa shetani.</char></note>, aj’irhudêkereza omu Bwâmi bwa Mugala wâge muzigirwa <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>warhucungulaga anarhukûlira e­byâha.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Amahwe g'okuyêmêrwa</para>
  <para style="s1">Kristu ye Mwâmi mukulu w’ebintu byoshi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Ye nshusho ya Nyamuzinda orhaboneka, ye Nfula omu biremwa byoshi.<verse eid="COL 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Bulya byoshi muli ye byalemagwa, emalunga n’en’igulu, ebiboneka n’ebirhaboneka, Entebe n’Amarhegesi, Amâmi n’Amahashe: byoshi byoshi ye wabilemaga, ye byanalemeragwa;<verse eid="COL 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>n’embere bibêho byoshi, yêhe erhi ho abà, ye nabihereza okubâho byoshi.<verse eid="COL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Kandi yêne y’irhwe ly’omubiri, yo Ekleziya; y’Imerero, ye Nfula omu bafîre; na ntyo ye murhanzi muli byoshi.<verse eid="COL 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda alonzize okumuhiramwo obwimâna bwoshi,<verse eid="COL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>na muli ye alonzize okugalula ebintu byoshi omu bwîra bwâge, ebiri en’igulu n’ebiri emalunga, alêrha omurhûla n’omukò gw’omusalaba gwâge.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakolosi nabo bakola bîra ba Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Ninyu mwe mwâli bigolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bigolo omu masù ga Nnâmahanga na bashombanyi bâge embere bamanye Kristu.</char></note> mîra na bashombanyi erhi nkengêro zinyu n’ebijiro binyu bibî birhuma, <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>lêro bunôla ashubir’immujira bîra bâge omu mubiri gw’Omugala, erhi afà, mpu lyo mubonekana batagatîfu, bêru-kwêru na banwererwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">omunwererwa: orhaliko ecakarhuma abulanwa, atumuzibwa</char></note> omu masù gâge, <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>caziga musêre buzibu omu buyêmêre, mumere emizî, mukomere munabè ntadungagana omu bulangâlire bw’Emyanzi y’Akalembe mwayumvagya; eyo Myanzi y’Akalembe yayigîrizîbwe ngasi ciremwa cibà en’igulu, hano idako ly’amalunga, nâni, nie Paolo, nahindusire mujà-bugo wayo.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukolo gwa Paolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Bunôla nsîmire omu malumwa ndwîrhe nabona mwe murhumire, nnandwîrhe nayunjuza omu mubiri gwâni ebibuzire oku mababale ga Kristu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngasi mukristu agwêrhe ecâge cigabi c’amababale akwânîne ayûshûle oku mababale ga Kristu; bulya rhuli birumhu by’omubiri gwâge, yo Ekleziya.</char></note>, nti lyo nkwânana omubiri gwâge, yo Ekleziya. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Nie ono nahindusire murhumisi w’eyo Ekleziya obujà-bugo Nyamuzinda ampâga muli mwe burhuma, mpu ndumîze Oluderho lwâge, <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>ly’ihwe lyàli lifulike kurhenga emyâka n’emyâka n’oku bantu ba mîra, na buno likola limanyirwe n’ahatagatîfu bâge. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Nyamuzinda alonzize okubayêreka obuhirhi bw’irenge bw’eryôla ihwe emwa abapagani: Kristu ali ekarhî kinyu, ye bulangâlire bw’irenge! <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Oyôla Kristu ye rhuhanûla, omu kurhonda ngasi muntu n’omu kuyigîriza ngasi muntu n’obusinganyanya boshi, nti lyo rhuhindula ngasi muntu abè mwimâna muli Kristu. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Eco co ntamira, omu kulwa entambala n’oburhabâle bw’emisî mpâbwa n’obuhashe bwâge.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Obushiru bwa Paolo oku Bakolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Nnonzize mumanye ntambala ndârhi ncindwîrhe nalwa mwe murhuma, nab’e Laodiceya, na ngasi bandi barhasâg’ibona obusù bwâni menemene. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Nnonzize emirhima yâbo erhûlûle, balungane bwenêne omu buzigire, banayunjule obuhirhi bw’obumanye, na ntyo bamanye ihwe lya Nyamuzinda, ye Kristu, <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>ye bamwo obuhirhi bwoshi bw’obushinganyanya n’obumanye. <verse eid="COL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Ndesire okwo nti lyo harhajira owammurheba n’ebinwa bw’obwengûza. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Bulya ciru akabà ntali muli mwe n’omubiri, ndi muli mwe n’omurhima, nnansîmire okubona muyôsire bwinjà buzira kavulindi munasêzire buzibu omu buyêmêre bwinyu muli Kristu.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">II. Mumanye mwankahabuka</para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzîne bw’okuli muli Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Ntyo mulame muli Nyakasane Yezu Kristu nka kulya mwamuyigîrizibagwa. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Mumumerekwo emizî munamusêrekwo, musimikire oku buyêmêre nka kulya mwayigîrizibagwa, munayôrhe mwavuga omunkwa. <verse eid="COL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Mumanye hankanajira owammujira bajà n’obwengûza bw’efilozofiya y’obunywesi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 8 </char><char style="xta" closed="false">Lolà </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:3">Gal 4, 3</ref>.</char></note>, erya eyegemêra emigenzo y’abantu n’ebiremwa by’en’igulu, ci arhali Kristu. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Bulya muli ye mwo obwimâna bwoshi bw’obunyamuzinda bubà omu mubiri, ninyu mushangîre obwo bwimâna muli ye, <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>ye irhwe lya ngasi Mâmi na ngasi Mahashe. <verse eid="COL 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Muli ye mwakembwîrwe obukembûle burhajiragwa na nfune za muntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwo bubatizo</char></note>, mwahogola omubiri gwinyu gw’ecâha: obwôla bwo bukembûle bwa Kristu. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Mwabishirwe haguma naye omu nshinda erhi mubatizibwa, kandi mwafûsire haguma naye omu nshinda erhi muyêmêra obuhashe bwa Nyamuzinda wamufûlaga omu bafù. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Mwe mwâli mufîre erhi byâha binyu n’okurhakembûlwa kw’emibiri yinyu birhuma, ashubir’immuhà obuzîne haguma naye, arhubabalira ebyâha bîrhu byoshi, <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>azaza ecêrhè c’omwenda rhwalimwo n’ebigabi byâco, acirhenza, acibamba oku musalaba. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Nago Amâmi n’Amabashe aganyaga, agabonêsa enshonyi omu masù g’igulu lyoshi, anagagwârha mpira zâge.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakristu barhankaziga babà bajà b’ebiremwa by’en’igulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Lêro irhondo harhacijiraga owammuderha oku biribwa n’oku binyôbwa, nîsi erhi oku biyêrekîre ensiku nkulu, erhi okubaluka kw’omwêzi, erhi olwa Sabato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabato lwo luzira.</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Ebyo byoshi biri cizunguzungu cône c’ebyaciyîsha; ci okuli kwônene guli mubiri gwa Kristu. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Ntâye ommurhebage mpu ammunyaga entanda yinyu omu kucîkungira obwîrhôhye bwâge bw’okugashâniza bamalahika. Ebyo byoshi biri bilôrho bya balya obucîbone bwâbo burhagwêrhi nsimiko n’obukengêre bw’ecinyamubiri burhunza. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Abôla bantu barhasêra oku irhwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">irhwe: Irhwe ly’Ekleziya, ye Kristu: Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:15-16">Efz 4, 15-16</ref></char>.</char></note> lilîsa omubiri gwoshi n’okugusimbanya, oku burhabâle bw’enungo n’emisî, mpu lyo gushunjûka muli Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="COL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Akabà mwafîre haguma na Kristu oku biremwa by’en’igulu, cici cicirhumaga mwayêmêra emiziro nka kulya muciri b’en’igulu? <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>Mpu: «Omanye wankahumakwo, omanye wankalabulakwo, omanye wankamamarhakwo!» <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Kali ebyo byoshi byalemeragwa okusherêra omu kukolêsibwa! Agôla marhegeko n’ezôla nyigîrizo ziri za bantu! <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Amarhegeko ga bene ago ganahash’ibonekana nka ga bantu bashinganyanya balonza obulyo bw’okugashâniza, n’obw’okucîrhohya, n’okubabaza omubiri; n’obwo ntà kamalo kâgo, na ntâkwo kankahash’ihima iralà ly’omubiri.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuzîne buhyâhya muli Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Obu mwafûsire haguma na Kristu, mukâg’ishwîra eby’enyanya, yo Kristu abutamîre ekulyo kwa Nyamuzinda; <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>mukânunirwa n’eby’enyanya, muleke okukalalikira eby’en’igulu. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Bulya mwafîre, n’obuzîne bwinyu bukola bubà bubishe haguma na Kristu muli Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Amango Kristu, ye buzîne bwinyu, acîyêrekana, ninyu mwayish’ilabuka mwe naye omu bukuze.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">III. Okushwinja</para>
  <para style="s1">Amarhegeko ngasi mukristu akwânîne okushimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Kuziga mubabaze ebirumbu by’omubiri gwinyu gw’en’igulu: obugonyi, eby’enshonyi, amasîma mabî, enyifinjo mbî, n’amagene g’eby’en’igulu, kwo kuli nka kufukamira ebiremwa; <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>ebyôla byo birhuma Nyamuzinda akunira. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Ninyu mw’ene ntyo kwo mwâli muyôsire mîra, amango mwacikâg’ikashimba ezo ngeso mbî. <verse eid="COL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Ci kwônene lêro bunôla ebyo byoshi mubijugucirage ninyu: obukunizi, ennongwè, obulyâlya, ebijâci n’enshambâlo mbî, birhahîra bikaciyumvikana omu kanwa kinyu. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Murhacikâg’irhebana mwene na nnene, bulya mwahongwîre omuntu wa mîra haguma n’engeso zâge, <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>mwacîhundikira omuhyâhya, olya ocîsêza okuhinduka nshusho y’Omulemi wâge, mpu lyo ahika oku bumanye bw’okunali. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Aha harhaciri Mugereki erhi Muyahudi; harhaciri mukembûle erhi ntakembûlwa, harhaciri ba-ntamanywa n'Abashita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abashita bâli bantamanywa (bashenzi) babaga eburhambi bw’Enyanja Nyirabula.</char></note>; harhaciri bajà erhi bantagengwa: akola Kristu yêne, ye byoshi muli boshi. <verse eid="COL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Nka kulya binakwânîne abîshogwa ba Nnâmahanga, n’abatagatîfu n’abarhonyi bâge, mucihundikire omurhima gw’olukogo, n’obwonjo, n’obwîrhôhye, n’obutûdu, n’okulembera amalibuko. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Mukâlemberana munababalirane aka­ba hali owagayîsize owâbo. Nyakasane ammubabalire: mumuyankirekwo olwiganyo. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Ci kulusha okwo kwoshi, muzigirane, bulya obuzigire ly’ishwinjiro ly’obwimâna. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Ntyo omurhûla gwa Kristu gugandâze omu mirhima yinyu: bulya ogwôla murhûla gwo mwahamagaliragwa mpu mubè mubiri muguma. Murhahusagya okukâvuga omunkwa! <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Oluderho Lwa Kristu lusêre bwenêne omu mirhima yinyu. Mukaz’ilubwirizanya, munakaz’ihanûlana n’obushinganyanya. N’omurhima gwinyu gwoshi mukâyimbira Nnâmahanga ennanga, ebîtakîro n’enyimbo z’obunya-mûka, munakamuvuga omunkwa. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Na ngasi ci­nwa mwankaderha erhi cijiro mwankajira, byoshi mubijire oku izîno lya Nyakasane Yezu, bibè munkwa emwa Larha Nyamuzinda oku bulagizi bwâge.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku abakristu bakwânîne okuyôrha omu mwa bâbwè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Bakazi, mukâyumva babalo, nka kulya bikwânîne muli Nyakasane. <verse eid="COL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Ba­lumè, muzigire bakinywi, murhanabayôrheraga kubî. <verse eid="COL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Bâna, mukâyumva ababusi binyu muli byoshi, bulya okwôla kwo kusîmîsa Nyakasane. <verse eid="COL 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Babusi, murhakâg’isholoshonza abâna binyu, mwakarhuma bârha omurhima. <verse eid="COL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Mwe bashizi, mukaz’iyumva bannawinyu b’en’igulu muli byoshi, arhali bulya mudwîrhe mwabonwa; nka kulya abalonza okusîma abantu bayôrha, ci n’omurhima nkana, bulya murhînyire Nyakasane. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Ngasi mukolo mwankajira, mugukole n’omurhima gwinyu gwoshi; Nyakasane abè ye mukolera, ci arhali ba­ntu. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Mumanye oku Nyakasane ayish’immuhemba, ammujire mîmo yâge. Kaz’imurhumikire Nyakasane Kristu! <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Bulya okola obubî ayish’ihâbwa oluhembo lw’obubî bwâge; na ntà kulola oyu ye ndi.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Mwe bashigwa, mukâhà bambali binyu ebishingânîne n’ebikwânîne. Mumanye oku ninyu mugwêrhe Nnawinyu omu mpingu.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omurhima gw’okulumîza Emyanzi y'Akalembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Muyôrhe muharâmya; mukâyîza omu kuvuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Murhusengerere nîrhu, lyo Nyamuzinda ayigulira oluderho lwîrhu olumvi, rhuhash’ihanûla ihwe lya Kristu; lyo lirhumire ndi omu nkoba. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Mâshi mbone obulyo bw’okulimanyîsa nk’oku nkwânîne okuliyigîriza! <verse eid="COL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Mubè bashinganya­nya omu lugendo lwinyu haguma n’ab’embuga; mukolêse bwinjà amango muhîrwe. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Iderha linyu libè lya kusîmîsa ensiku zoshi, linunîrire nka munyu, munamany’ishuza ngasi yêshi okukwânîne.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emyanzi ya Paolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Emyanzi yâni yoshi, mwene wîrhu muzigirwa Tikiko, muganda okwânîne okucîkubagirwa na murhabâzi wâni omu mukolo muli Nyakasane, ammubwîrayo. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Co cirhumire mmurhumirage, nti amuhè emyanzi yîrhu anammurhûlirize emirhima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">milongo 8-9, lolà Amaruba Mutagatîfu Paolo ayandikiraga Filemoni.</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Murhumire bo na Onezimo, mwene wîrhu muzigirwa onakwânîne okucîkubagirwa; ali w’emwinyu. Bammushambalira emyanzi y’eno munda yoshi.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo n’obwangà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Aristarko rhubà rhweshi omu nkoba ammulamusize, bona Marko, muzâla wa Barnaba. Y’olya bammubwîraga; akayisha emwinyu mumuyankirire kwinjà; <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Yezu naye, oderhwa Yusto, mpu asingi. Omu bakembûle boshi, abo bônene bantabâla okulumîza Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda; bàbîre burhûlirize bwâni. <verse eid="COL 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Epafra, oburhwa emwinyu, mwambali wa Kristu Yezu, ammulamusize; arhahusa okummulwîrakwo omu nsengero zâge, mpu lyo muzibuha, muyôrhe muli bimâna, munasêre oku ngasi ebi Nnâmahanga alonzize byoshi. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Nêci, mmuhîre obu buhamîrize: arhagohya erhi mwe murhuma, mwe n’ab’e Laodiceya n’e Hiyerapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Luka, mufumu muzigirwa, na Dema, bammuhîre omusingo.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Mulamuse bene wîrhu b’e Laodiceya, na Ninfa haguma n’endêko y’abemêzi babugânana aha mwâge. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Aga maruba hano muyûs’igasoma, mugend’igasomêkeza n’omu Ekleziya y’e Laodiceya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wabona go galya rhuderha nti ayandikiraga Abefezi.</char></note>. Ninyu kwo na kuguma, muhûne ag’e Laodiceya, mugasome. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Mumbwîrire Arkipo, erhi: «Mpu omanye obugo wahâbagwa muli Nyakasane, onacisêze okubuyunjuza». <verse eid="COL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Ogu musingo guli gwa kuboko kwâni niene Paolo. Mukâkengêra enkoba zâni! Enshôkano ya Nnâmahanga ebè ninyu!<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
